{#
  « Redirection actuelle » — where the calls go RIGHT NOW, as read from the
  provider, not what the planning says they should (issue #750): the
  planning is the rule, this is the fact.

  Since issue #1026 it also carries the one correction the page can make.
  The button appears only when the provider's real state and the
  destination the planning expects are both known and DIFFER:

      inactive, a destination expected      → « Réactiver la redirection »
      active, but on another number         → « Resynchroniser la redirection »
      conform / unreadable / no destination → no button

  Shared between dashboard.html.twig and SosAdminController's answer to the
  correction (which hands the refreshed block back to public/assets/js/
  sos-admin.js), so the two can never drift. `redirect_action` is
  'reactivate', 'resync' or null.
#}
<section class="border rounded-3 p-3 mb-4" id="sos-status-banner" aria-labelledby="sos-status-title">
    <div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-2">
        {% if live_state.error %}
            {% set dot_class = 'text-danger' %}
        {% elseif live_state.active %}
            {% set dot_class = 'text-success' %}
        {% else %}
            {% set dot_class = 'text-body-secondary' %}
        {% endif %}
        <i class="bi bi-circle-fill small mt-1 {{ dot_class }}" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <div>
            {% if live_state.error %}
                <h2 class="h6 mb-1 text-danger" id="sos-status-title">État de la redirection illisible chez le fournisseur</h2>
                <p class="small mb-0">{{ live_state.error }}</p>
            {% elseif live_state.active %}
                <h2 class="h6 mb-1" id="sos-status-title">Redirection active chez le fournisseur</h2>
                <p class="small mb-0">
                    Les appels{% if sos_number %} au {{ sos_number }}{% endif %} sont actuellement redirigés vers
                    <strong>{% if live_state.label %}{{ live_state.label }} — {% endif %}{{ live_state.number }}</strong>.
                </p>
            {% else %}
                <h2 class="h6 mb-1" id="sos-status-title">Redirection inactive chez le fournisseur</h2>
                <p class="small mb-0">
                    Les appels{% if sos_number %} au {{ sos_number }}{% endif %} ne sont actuellement redirigés vers aucun
                    téléphone.
                </p>
            {% endif %}

            {% if redirect_action %}
                <p class="small mb-2 mt-2" id="sos-redirect-expected">
                    D'après les gardes, les appels devraient être redirigés vers
                    <strong>{% if redirect_expected_label %}{{ redirect_expected_label }} — {% endif %}{{ redirect_expected_number }}</strong>.
                </p>
                {# One click starts it — no confirmation (issue #1026). The
                   script disables the button while the provider is being
                   asked and shows the spinner; the outcome is the site's
                   toast, never text left in the page. #}
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary" id="sos-redirect-sync"
                        data-redirect-action="{{ redirect_action }}">
                    <span class="spinner-border spinner-border-sm me-1 d-none" aria-hidden="true" data-redirect-spinner></span>
                    <span data-redirect-label>{{ redirect_action == 'reactivate' ? 'Réactiver la redirection' : 'Resynchroniser la redirection' }}</span>
                </button>
            {% elseif redirect_expected_number is null and not live_state.error %}
                <p class="small text-warning-emphasis mb-0 mt-2" id="sos-redirect-no-destination">
                    <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    Aucun destinataire valide n'est disponible (ni garde, ni numéro par défaut utilisable) : la
                    redirection ne peut pas être corrigée d'ici.
                </p>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
